---
const points = [
  { title: '19 years of medical industry experience', text: 'Real-world experience in plastic surgery, medical aesthetics, medical device sales, and executive sales and marketing leadership.' },
  { title: 'Sales experience, not just social media experience', text: 'We understand front desk operations, patient coordinators, lead follow-up, consultation scheduling, and conversion challenges.' },
  { title: 'An executive-level perspective', text: 'Our work connects brand awareness, marketing, internal operations, and sales performance instead of treating them as separate functions.' },
  { title: 'We look beyond the lead', text: 'A successful advertising campaign means little when incoming inquiries are not handled properly. We help find the gaps and improve the processes that drive conversion.' },
  { title: 'Hands-on industry knowledge', text: 'We understand the pace, patient expectations, competition, technology, and business demands of the medical aesthetics industry.' },
  { title: 'One connected growth strategy', text: 'From the first impression to the booked consultation and beyond, we make every stage of patient acquisition stronger.' },
];
---
<section id="difference" class="container-lux py-28 md:py-40" aria-labelledby="diff-title">
  <div class="grid items-end gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16" data-reveal>
    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Luminary Difference</p>
      <h2 id="diff-title" class="h-display mt-6 text-4xl md:text-6xl">We do not just understand marketing. <span class="text-gold-shine font-medium">We understand what happens after it.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-end gap-5 lg:col-span-4 lg:justify-end">
      <p class="font-display text-[6.5rem] font-extralight leading-[.8] text-gold-shine md:text-[8rem]" aria-hidden="true">19</p>
      <p class="pb-1 text-[0.68rem] uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.26em] text-champagne">Years in<br />medical<br />aesthetics</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul data-stagger class="mt-16 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-0 md:mt-20 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {points.map((p, i) => (
      <li class="row-hover border-t border-ivory/12 py-9 md:pr-4">
        <h3 class="font-display text-[1.35rem] font-normal leading-snug text-ivory">{p.title}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-7 text-ivory/65">{p.text}</p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-8 border-t border-ivory/12 pt-12 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between" data-reveal>
    <p class="max-w-2xl font-display text-xl font-light leading-snug text-ivory/90 md:text-2xl">Your success requires more than great content. It requires the right strategy, the right team, the right follow-up, and an understanding of how your business works.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-lux inline-flex shrink-0 self-start md:self-auto">Book a strategy call</a>
  </div>
</section>
